From 85c629db7a2780f26a21ae54425fc22397b55b89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:16:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf: one badge call per page, own chats only, slower
 background reload

Team review findings #6 and #12 (docs/qa/TEAM_REVIEW.md).

- New stable my_nav_counts() replaces three calls per signed-in page;
  refresh_my_age() runs only when age_outdated is set.
- list_my_conversations reads candidates from the viewer's memberships,
  keeping can_use_conversation as the audience check.
- Indexes on conversations(user_high) (direct) and push_outbox(actor_id).
- RefreshOnResume reloads an open tab every 5 minutes instead of 60 s.
- pgTAP nav_counts.test.sql (14 checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
